# "Each opponent can cast spells only any time they could cast a sorcery": in Bot2's own upkeep (turn 4) its Lightning Bolt is
# refused, though Mox Ruby is untapped; in its own first main phase, with an empty stack, the same Bolt is allowed (the positive
# control) and hits Bot1. Teferi's controller is not restricted, only his opponents.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Pearl
Mox Sapphire
Mox Jet
Teferi, Time Raveler
Island x16

[Bot2 Deck]
Mox Ruby
Lightning Bolt
Island x18

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Sapphire.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Pearl.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Sapphire.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Teferi, Time Raveler.Cast
Bot2.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
[T4 Bot2.Upkeep]
! Bot2.Hand.Lightning Bolt.Cast(Bot1)
[T4 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
Bot2.Hand.Lightning Bolt.Cast(Bot1)

[Expect]
Bot1.Life = 17
